{"sourceUrl":"https://mks.hfut.edu.cn/2026/0616/c8870a319722/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:00.049868+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mks.hfut.edu.cn/2026/0616/c8870a319722/page.htm","html":"<div><p><strong><span> </span></strong></p><p><span>合肥工业大学马克思主义学院将举办第二届全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营，本次夏令营拟招收</span><span>70</span><span>人，将开展开营仪式、学术讲座、专业介绍、导师交流等活动。</span><strong></strong></p><p><strong><span>一、时间安排</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>报名时间：</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>17</span><span>日</span><span>-6</span><span>月</span><span>30</span><span>日</span></p><p><span>活动时间：</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>11</span><span>日</span><span>-7</span><span>月</span><span>12</span><span>日</span><strong></strong></p><p><strong><span>二、申请条件</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>1.</span><span>主要面向综合表现优异的</span><span> 2027 </span><span>届本科生，思想政治教育、马克思主义理论与中共党史党建等相关专业。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>遵纪守法，品行优良，无任何违法违纪受处分记录。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>身心健康，学风端正，具有较强的科研创新能力和学术实践能力，具有继续深造攻读研究生的愿望与潜质，对所报专业有浓厚的兴趣。</span><strong></strong></p><p><strong><span>三、申请与审核流程</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>1.</span><strong><span>申请人须提供以下材料：</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）《合肥工业大学</span><span>2026</span><span>年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表》</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）本科前三年成绩单、综合测评成绩单（加盖学校或院系教务部门公章）</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）专家推荐信一封</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）<span>英语水平证明</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span>5</span><span>）<span>身份证扫描件（正反面）</span></span></p><p><span>（6）其他证明材料（已发表论文、获奖证书或其他考试证书的复印件）</span></p><p><span>2.</span><strong><span>报名方式：</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>申请人将申请材料按顺序扫描合并成一个</span><strong><span>PDF</span></strong><strong><span>格式电子文件</span></strong><span>，大小不超过</span><span>10M</span><span>，文件命名为<strong>“马克思主义学院夏令营</strong></span><strong><span>2026-</span></strong><strong><span>姓名</span></strong><strong><span>-</span></strong><strong><span>本科学校”</span></strong><span>，发送至指定邮箱：</span><strong><span>hfutmksxgb@163.com</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>3.</span><strong><span>材料审核及营员选拔</span></strong></p><p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）学院根据学生提交的申请材料，对照申请条件，依据公布的参营人数和校内外参营比例，确定夏令营参营名单并在合肥工业大学马克思主义学院网站上公布。</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）已被选拔的营员要在参营名单公布之日起</span><span>2</span><span>日内按照通知加入对应</span><span>QQ</span><span>群，逾期未加入的视为放弃此资格。</span></p><p><strong><span>四、日程安排</span></strong><strong></strong></p><div><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span>日期</span></p></td><td><p><span>时间</span></p></td><td><p><span>活动内容</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>11</span><span>日</span></p></td><td><p><span>全天</span></p><p><span>（9:30-18:00）</span></p></td><td><p><span>夏令营报到</span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"6\"><p><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>12</span><span>日</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span>上午</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>开营仪式</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>合影、学院介绍与参观</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>学术报告</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span>下午</span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>导师见面交流会</span></p></td></tr><tr></tr><tr><td><p><span>闭营仪式</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><strong><span><span>五、</span></span></strong><strong><span>入营须知</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>1.</span><strong><span>报到地点：</span></strong><span>安徽省合肥市丹霞路</span><span>485</span><span>号合肥工业大学翡翠湖校区建筑艺术馆</span><span>613</span><span>会议室。入选营员在报到时必须携带如下材料：本人身份证（原件）、学生证（原件）、合肥工业大学</span><span>2026</span><span>年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表（打印并签字盖章）。</span><strong></strong></p><p><strong><span>2.</span><span>学生食宿及交通</span></strong><span></span></p><p><span>外地院校学生请自行预定往返车票及住宿。我院为入营学生提供夏令营期间的校内餐食费用补贴，并统一购买在合肥工业大学活动期间的人身意外伤害保险。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>入营学员须全程参加夏令营各项活动，中途不得随意中断活动。</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>所有材料需在报到时提交纸质版，并当场签署安全责任书。</span></p><p><span>5.</span><span>所有材料必须真实有效。如有不实，一经查实，将取消参营资格。</span></p><p><strong><span>六、联系方式</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>联系人：陈老师、张老师</span></p><p><span>咨询电话：</span><span>0551-63831226</span><span>、</span><span>19946258525</span><span>、</span><span>13739255406</span><span>学院邮箱：</span><span>hfutmksxgb@163.com</span></p><p><span>学院网站：</span><span><a href=\"http://mks.hfut.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://mks.hfut.edu.cn/</span></a></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mks.hfut.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://mks.hfut.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/89/ea/737e5a7a4c75b95426b132d23e09/db38b35e-26e1-45db-b48b-c48706ae7c69.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：合肥工业大学马克思主义学院全国优秀大学生夏令营报名表.doc</a></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mks.hfut.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://mks.hfut.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/89/ea/737e5a7a4c75b95426b132d23e09/911caee0-0c25-46bb-a5c6-9f8b620f6c33.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：合肥工业大学马克思主义学院2026年优秀大学生夏令营专家推荐信.docx</a></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>合肥工业大学马克思主义学院</span></p><p><span><span>                       </span><span>  </span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>16</span><span>日</span><strong></strong></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"9623fe003b26109a587e5fd110aa76b2fb3f5066d55028748c05dadf0c16349e","textLength":1214,"sourceSha256":"f300217093031ba34381c21d4b44eba36e6b43384bced57d577f56a172c2b854","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-fc208b294df0453c2c36","title":"2026年合肥工业大学马克思主义学院2026年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:00.049868+00:00"}
